Collaboration & Communication Protocol
Before writing significant code, present a brief execution plan (files, structure, approach) for alignment.

When choosing between a fast/simple approach and a more sophisticated one, present both with a recommended option based on project goals.

Ensure every major architectural decision is paired with a clear, concise verbal summary suitable for technical interview discussions.